# design-sync working state — all regenerated by `.design-sync/gen-sources.mjs`
# plus the staged converter. See <slug>/.design-sync/NOTES.md.
#
# The durable set under .design-sync/ IS committed: config.json, NOTES.md,
# conventions.md, and the generator/checker scripts.

# Staged converter scripts + their node_modules
.ds-sync/

# Converter output
ds-bundle/

# Generated staging package (derived from the token SSOT on every run).
# Leading **/ is required: a pattern with an interior slash is anchored to this
# file's directory, so a bare `.design-sync/pkg/` would miss `<slug>/.design-sync/pkg/`.
**/.design-sync/pkg/

# Machine state: font cache, remote anchors, fan-out scratch
**/.design-sync/.cache/
**/.design-sync/learnings/
**/.design-sync/node_modules/
